{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Take to the skies over the western front in this WW1 casual run and gun style Sim-Shooter. Play as an Allied or German pilot in 6 different planes from 1915-1918. Balloon Busting, Ground Attack, and Dogfighting missions await you!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Supports Touch / Mouse / XBOX controller</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 Allied planes to fly: Airco DH2, Nieuport, and the Sopwith Camel, each more maneuverable and durable than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 German planes to fly: Fokker E, Albatros D, and the Fokker Triplane, each more maneuverable and durable than the last</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5 Historical Aces to shoot down or fly with: Max Immelmann, Oswald Boelcke, Werner Voss, Erwin B\u00f6hme, and Manfred von Richthofen (the Red Baron)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >100+ missions in story mode covering the spring of 1916 to the spring of 1918 (Allied) or the fall of 1915 to the spring of 1918 (German)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ground attack, balloon busting, and aerial dogfighting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn endurance missions, medals, and increase your rank as you complete the story missions</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3477890?t=1761760195","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477890/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761760195","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477890/e7582e870814b56c2e39b244229abb686a3c7f53/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761760195","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3477890/e7582e870814b56c2e39b244229abb686a3c7f53/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761760195","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},